      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a research paper about linguistic framing in journalism. I'm trying to look at how news outlets use different vocabulary to describe civil unrest. Can you help me analyze how the tone and word choice usually differ when media covers \"protests\" versus \"riots\" in various urban settings?",
